{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 33, :comments ["And the reason for <b>\"and they perished from among the assembly\"</b> is that they vanished before their eyes, while they were among them standing with them, for in an instant the earth opened its mouth and closed over them, and their place was not known where it was. And Ibn Ezra said (on Numbers 16:33): on account of the death of their sons who stood in their stead."], :book :numbers, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T04:06:20.414312630Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}